    "turn_text": "Welcome to a bonus episode of the Daily Signal Podcast for Thursday, November 21st. I'm Rachel Dell Judas, and I'm sharing my exclusive interview with Congressman Jody Heisz of Georgia, where we take a closer look at Democrats' push to impeach President Donald Trump as they hold their second week of impeachment hearings. We hope you enjoy. We're joined today on the Daily Signal Podcast by Congressman Jody Heisz, who represents Georgia's 10th congressional district. Congressman Heisz, thank you so much for being with us today.",
