        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "When John Radcliffe asked witnesses why they were present, there was complete silence.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The alleged misconduct has shifted from 'quid pro quo' to 'extortion' to 'bribery'.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
