        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The president was denied the right to defend himself during the inquiry.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "Members of the minority party were unable to present their own witnesses.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
